<title>JAPAN: Sanwa Elec to issue 40 mln Sfr warrant.</title>
<headline>Sanwa Elec to issue 40 mln Sfr warrant.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Sanwa Elec Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura Bamk (Switzerland) Ltd</p>
<p>GUARANTOR - Tokyo-Mitsubishi Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE warrant	   ISSUE NO		AMT   40 million Sfr</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 30.Jan.01</p>
<p> EXER PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p>EXER FROM 10.Feb.97  EXER TO 19.Jan.01</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 30.Jan.97  INT PAY 30.Jan</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 22.Jan.97 SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon, conversion price and currency rate will be decided on January 22..</p>
</text>
